+/// SavedState support by KV mode (pure policy; the engine branches below call these so unit tests cover
+/// the exact predicate). K8V4 (kv_hybrid): no capture, restore, or offers - RAM or disk.
+inline bool kv_saved_supported(bool kv_hybrid) { return !kv_hybrid; }
