+/// Startup mode gate (pure policy, CPU-testable): SavedState capture/restore/disk/inventory run only
+/// when the upstream conversation cache is NOT opted in (mib>0 && slots>0 && prompt_cache>0 enables
+/// it) and there is no layer split (SavedState items carry no carve tags yet, so a split session must
+/// never capture or mount them). K8V4 stays runtime-gated via kv_saved_supported(). The engine folds
